Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 17:07:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] fix(qwen3-next): list the current parametrized ids of the
 gated parameter-VJP fold test

test_cuda_gated_parameter_vjp_contributions_match_the_fold gained a shape
parameter in a2037197, so its ids are [shapeN-activation-dtypeM] (8 of them),
but the operator case manifest still listed the four old [activation-dtypeM]
ids. The operator gate passes the manifest ids to pytest, which reported
'not found' and marked all 233 mandatory cases missing, so the preflight
operators step failed on any GPU. Replace the four ids by the eight current
ones.

Signed-off-by: Wenbo Ji <36562829+fusheng-ji@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 .../models/qwen3_next/qwen3_next_operator_cases.json | 12 ++++++++----
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

